 /* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
+   Device, PACE_KK_RHOW=3: ComputeWeights from the target-sorted records (d_sg_*).  A team is one segment
+   of PACE_SEG records over team_size_fo consecutive atoms (the record reads are uniform across a warp, the
+   A reads and weight adds coalesce over atoms).  Each thread recomputes every record's leave-one-out
+   product from its other factors, sums consecutive records with the same target in registers and issues
+   one atomic pair per run instead of one per record; the last segment index does the rank-1 terms.
+------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
